# SEO & performance

## SEO

- Route SEO via `src/lib/seo.ts` + `SeoManager` (Helmet). New routes: unique title (~50–60), description (~140–160), canonical, OG/Twitter, hreflang alternates.
- One `<h1>` per page; nest headings without skipping levels.
- Navigation with `<Link>` / `<a>` and descriptive text — not button-as-link for internal routes.
- `target="_blank"` → `rel="noopener noreferrer"`. Images: meaningful `alt`; decorative → `alt=""` + `aria-hidden`.
- High-value pages may add JSON-LD (`Organization`, `WebSite`, `BreadcrumbList`, etc.) when relevant.

## Performance (CWV)

- LCP/hero media: eager / high fetch priority, real dimensions, modern formats (webp/avif) + `sizes`.
- Below-fold: `loading="lazy"`. Reserve space (`width`/`height` or `aspect-*`) to avoid CLS.
- Code-split heavy non-critical UI (`React.lazy`). Prefer platform APIs (`Intl`) over new utility deps.
- Non-urgent updates: `useTransition` / `useDeferredValue` when they clearly help INP.
